Vacancy ref: 58288
Business area: Surf and Conventional
Working hours: 40 hours per week
Contract type: Staff
Reports to: SCM Manager
Responsibilities
Assists the Chartering Coordinator to pre-qualify Ship-owners, Agents and Brokers;
