From the Bidder's list, contacts suppliers, assist the Chartering Coordinator as needed to launch invitations to tender, collect offers, clarify, negotiate and draw up a table of comparison/recommendation;
In dialogue and validation by the Chartering Coordinator, SCM Manager, submits the recommendation to the Project Management Team for approval;
With the assistance of the Chartering Coordinator, Contract Engineer/Manager and SCM Manager, negotiate the terms & conditions (T&C’s);
