Organises/Coordinates Vessel audits in Nigeria
Assists the Chartering Coordinator and the SCM Manager for issuing quotations, budgets and studies to the other Departments;
Attends meetings with other Departments (Operations, HSEQ, Legal…);
Captures savings;
Develops and fosters a positive HSEQ culture throughout NigerStar 7.
